{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39207","headline":"题淮阴侯庙 · 韦庄","name":"题淮阴侯庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满把椒浆奠楚祠，碧幢黄钺旧英威。\n能扶汉代成王业，忍见唐民陷战机。\n云梦去时高鸟尽，淮阴归日故人稀。\n如何不借平齐策，空看长星落贼围。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}